    <?php foreach($rows as $r):$rid=(int)$r['id'];$items=$itemsByReturn[$rid]??[];$status=(string)$r['status'];$customer=(string)($r['username']?:$r['guest_email']?:$r['customer_name']);$returnValue=(float)($returnValues[$rid]??0);$maxRefund=(float)($maxRefunds[$rid]??0);?>
    <details class="admin-return-record" <?=$openReturnId===$rid?'open':''?>>
      <summary>
        <span class="admin-return-order"><strong>#<?=$rid?> · <?=$h((string)$r['order_number'])?></strong><small><?=$h((string)$r['reason'])?></small></span>
        <span><?=$h($customer)?></span>
        <strong><?=count($items)?></strong>
        <span><strong><?=number_format($returnValue,2)?> <?=$h((string)$r['currency'])?></strong><small>Order total <?=number_format((float)$r['grand_total'],2)?></small></span>
        <span class="status-badge status-<?=$h($status)?>"><?=$h(strtoupper($status))?></span>
        <span><?=web_local_datetime($r['requested_at']??null,'—')?></span>
        <span class="admin-return-manage">Manage</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="admin-return-body">
        <div class="admin-return-reason"><small>CUSTOMER REASON</small><strong><?=$h((string)$r['reason'])?></strong><?php if(trim((string)($r['customer_note']??''))!==''):?><p><?=$h((string)$r['customer_note'])?></p><?php endif;?></div>
        <div class="admin-return-items"><?php foreach($items as $item):$returnImage=store_image_path($item['image_path']??'');if($returnImage==='')$returnImage=store_image_path($item['current_image_path']??'');?><article><div><?php if($returnImage!==''):?><img data-admin-image src="<?=$h(url(store_image_variant_path($returnImage,'sm')))?>" alt=""><?php else:?><span>NO IMG</span><?php endif;?></div><span><strong><?=$h((string)$item['product_name'])?></strong><small><?=$h((string)($item['variant_label']??''))?> · Qty <?=(int)$item['quantity']?></small></span><?php if($status==='completed'):?><b><?=!empty($item['restock'])?'RESTOCKED':'NOT RESTOCKED'?></b><?php endif;?></article><?php endforeach;?></div>
        <?php if($status==='requested'):?><form method="post" class="admin-return-review-form"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="review"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$rid?>"><label class="app-field admin-field admin-field-wide"><span>Review note <small>optional</small></span><textarea name="admin_note" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Reason for approval or rejection"></textarea></label><div class="admin-form-actions"><button class="app-button admin-button primary" type="submit" name="decision" value="approve">Approve return</button><button class="app-button admin-button danger" type="submit" name="decision" value="reject" data-confirm="Reject this return request?" data-confirm-tone="danger">Reject</button></div></form>
        <?php elseif($status==='approved'):?><form method="post" class="admin-return-complete-form"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="complete"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$rid?>"><div class="admin-return-restock"><span>RESTOCK DECISION</span><p>Select only items that are physically back and sellable. Completing the return writes inventory movements immediately.</p><?php foreach($items as $item):?><label><input type="checkbox" name="restock[<?=(int)$item['order_item_id']?>]" value="1"><span>Restock <?=$h((string)$item['product_name'])?> · Qty <?=(int)$item['quantity']?></span></label><?php endforeach;?></div><div class="admin-form-grid admin-form-grid-compact"><label class="app-field admin-field"><span>Refund amount · <?=$h((string)$r['currency'])?></span><input type="number" name="refund_amount" min="0" max="<?=number_format($maxRefund,2,'.','')?>" step="0.01" value="<?=number_format($maxRefund,2,'.','')?>" required data-return-refund-input><small>Maximum refundable after discounts and previous refunds: <?=number_format($maxRefund,2)?> <?=$h((string)$r['currency'])?>.</small><button class="app-button admin-button secondary small" type="button" data-return-use-max data-value="<?=number_format($maxRefund,2,'.','')?>">Use max refundable</button></label><label class="app-field admin-field"><span>Refund method</span><select name="refund_method"><option value="">Choose refund method</option><option value="cash">Cash</option><option value="instapay">InstaPay</option><option value="bank_transfer">Bank transfer</option><option value="wallet">Wallet</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></label><label class="app-field admin-field"><span>Refund reference</span><input name="refund_reference" maxlength="160" placeholder="Required for non-cash refunds"></label><label class="app-field admin-field admin-field-wide"><span>Completion note <small>optional</small></span><textarea name="admin_note" rows="2" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><?=admin_password_field('Confirm admin password to complete return')?></div><button class="app-button admin-button primary" type="submit" data-confirm="Complete this return with the selected refund and restock choices?">Complete return</button></form>
        <?php else:?><div class="admin-return-result"><span>Refund recorded</span><strong><?=number_format((float)$r['refund_amount'],2)?> <?=$h((string)$r['currency'])?></strong><?php if(!empty($r['refund_method'])):?><span><?=htmlspecialchars(ucwords(str_replace('_',' ',(string)$r['refund_method'])),ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8')?><?php if(!empty($r['refund_reference'])):?> · <?=$h((string)$r['refund_reference'])?><?php endif;?></span><?php endif;?><?php if(trim((string)($r['admin_note']??''))!==''):?><p><?=$h((string)$r['admin_note'])?></p><?php endif;?></div><?php endif;?>
      </div>
    </details>
    <?php endforeach;?>
  </div><?php endif;?>
</section>
